{"entities":"[{\"text\": \"bradycardia\", \"id\": \"D001919\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"hypotension\", \"id\": \"D007022\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"timolol\", \"id\": \"D013999\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"pilocarpine\", \"id\": \"D010862\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"pilocarpine nitrate\", \"id\": \"D010862\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"timolol maleate\", \"id\": \"D013999\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"bradycardia\", \"id\": \"D001919\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"hypotensive\", \"id\": \"D007022\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"halothane\", \"id\": \"D006221\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"timolol\", \"id\": \"D013999\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"pilocarpine\", \"id\": \"D010862\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"Timolol\", \"id\": \"D013999\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"pilocarpine\", \"id\": \"D010862\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"timolol\", \"id\": \"D013999\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"halothane\", \"id\": \"D006221\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"bradycardia\", \"id\": \"D001919\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"hypotension\", \"id\": \"D007022\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"Pilocarpine\", \"id\": \"D010862\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}]","filtered_entities":[{"text":"bradycardia","id":"D001919","label":"Disease"},{"text":"hypotension","id":"D007022","label":"Disease"},{"text":"timolol maleate","id":"D013999","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"pilocarpine nitrate","id":"D010862","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"halothane","id":"D006221","label":"Chemical"}],"head":"halothane","head_id":"D006221","pairs":[{"head":"timolol maleate","tail":"bradycardia","head_id":"D013999","tail_id":"D001919"},{"head":"timolol maleate","tail":"hypotension","head_id":"D013999","tail_id":"D007022"},{"head":"pilocarpine nitrate","tail":"bradycardia","head_id":"D010862","tail_id":"D001919"},{"head":"pilocarpine nitrate","tail":"hypotension","head_id":"D010862","tail_id":"D007022"},{"head":"halothane","tail":"bradycardia","head_id":"D006221","tail_id":"D001919"},{"head":"halothane","tail":"hypotension","head_id":"D006221","tail_id":"D007022"}],"relations":["D013999 | D001919","D010862 | D001919","D006221 | D001919"],"result":"$","tail":"hypotension","tail_id":"D007022","text":"Intraoperative bradycardia and hypotension associated with timolol and pilocarpine eye drops. A 69-yr-old man, who was concurrently being treated with pilocarpine nitrate and timolol maleate eye drops, developed a bradycardia and became hypotensive during halothane anaesthesia. Both timolol and pilocarpine were subsequently identified in a 24-h collection of urine. Timolol (but not pilocarpine) was detected in a sample of plasma removed during surgery; the plasma concentration of timolol (2.6 ng ml-1) was consistent with partial beta-adrenoceptor blockade. It is postulated that this action may have been enhanced during halothane anaesthesia with resultant bradycardia and hypotension. Pilocarpine may have had a contributory effect.","metrics":{"precision":0.6666666666666666,"recall":0.5,"f1":0.5714285714285714,"rel_tp":2,"rel_fp":1,"rel_fn":2}}